<title>USA: PerfectData majority-owned unit sets IPO.</title>
<headline>PerfectData majority-owned unit sets IPO.</headline>
<dateline>SIMI VALLEY, Calif. 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>PerfectData Corp said Thursday its 64-percent owned unit, Starnet Universe Internet Inc, has filed for an initial public offering of its common stock.</p>
<p>Starnet, a Web server and Internet service provider, also launched its Internet bridal registry and wedding coordinator, &quot;The Internet Wedding Coordinator.&quot;</p>
<p>The Internet Wedding Coordinator offers brides and grooms the opportunity to announce their engagement and plan their entire wedding without leaving their home, the company said.</p>
</text>
